# 用量 on the desktop (sfdesk usage.mbt, the web's Usage.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up chat. 用量 from the
# rail; a day pointed at, another clicked; 30 天; the lists by chat, by model.
timeout 30000
until 按空格输入
wait 600
tap icon:chart
wait 1500
move 444 425
wait 900
tapxy 762 425
wait 900
move 1000 120
wait 600
tap 30 天
wait 1500
tap 7 天
wait 900
tap 按对话
wait 1200
tap 按模型
wait 1200
exit
